      "alt": "TQMa8MxML board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX8M Mini with enhanced Audio properties.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa8MxML Embedded Module is built around the i.MX8M Mini processor, featuring an Arm Cortex-A53 core, making it an ideal choice for applications with demanding audio and graphical needs. This module offers advanced audio properties and integrates a Cortex M4 for real-time and security functionalities. With support for high-speed communication, it features 1x Gbit Ethernet, 1x PCle, and 2x USB 2.0 interfaces. Additionally, the integrated graphics controller with GPU and hardware acceleration facilitates complex graphics, while the module is available in multiple CPU variants with varying performance levels.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:19:29 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
